<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $1</p>
<p>million Stuttgart clay-court men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Fernando Meligeni (Brazil) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Magnus Larsson (Sweden) beat 13-Greg Rusedski (Britain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-7 (2-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Alberto Portas (Spain) beat 1-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>7-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat 16-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 2-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>9-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech Republic) 6-3 7-5</p>
</text>
